CollectData [SimTalk] - GanttChart
Sets if the GanttChart designated by <Path> collects data (true) or does not collect data (false).
Remarks
You cannot use setData and automatically collect the data simultaneously. When you assign true to
CollectData, do not call the method setData.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.CollectData:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyGanttChart.CollectData := true
SimTalk
setData [SimTalk]
See also
Collect Data [check box] - GanttChart
CollectData [SimTalk] - GanttChart
